&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Great communication skills: You will be required to present to senior clients regularly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3151 - Senior Associate Director, Search - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SEM Senior Associate Director acts as our client’s senior partner and expert for all paid search for an area of business. This role is responsible for delivering best in class media campaigns to meet our client’s KPIs, including managing Google Marketing’s very own Google Ads, SA360, and other SEM portfolios.&amp;nbsp; Success in this role involves providing strategic insight across a breadth of products and channels, partnering with our client and planning leads on projects, owning best practice and optimization strategies, and inspiring a large team (including ultimate responsibility for quality of work within this team).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of the things we’d like you to do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Activation lead and Client Services in capacity planning &amp;amp; resource management for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the ultimate owner of media activation best practices, adherence, and automation for your team, while coordinating with the NA/EMEA/APAC teams to ensure consistency and excellence across regions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with key clients, fostering strong relationships and collaborating to deliver innovative thinking and inform our future activation product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports the strategic vision and drives the overall growth of campaigns, acting as the senior strategic advisor to key clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivers actionable, top-level recommendations that empower the team to drive continuous performance improvement and exceed client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ultimate accountability for adherence to controls and best practices across all relevant platforms and help to manage regional development of search best practice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalating any potential conflicts between best practice and what is best for their region&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the primary contact point of contact between the Media Activation team and regular stakeholders both internal &amp;amp; external&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with your client, and key suppliers, leading team communications with these stakeholders. Be able to communicate with clients on subjects outside your remit, and provide them with useful insight, working independently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcase thought leadership pieces &amp;amp; POVs throughout the course of the year to galvanise and elevate the role within wider industry as an expert&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver quarterly, semi-annual, or annual updates on work quality as it relates to owned workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an inspiring and motivational Leader, leading by example while encouraging and coaching juniors on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain a more strategic understanding of the client’s business and KPIs, and keep up to date with latest Industry news and be proactive in spotting trends, product releases, and other opportunities which could enhance our activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the wider regional paid search strategy &amp;amp; goals, provide strategic insight to individual campaign wrap-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide timely and actionable feedback to the team to aid in their development, improvement, and progress. Provide awareness and recognition for jobs well done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progression in a role managing a staff of 5+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills across all platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert organisational skills, great attention to detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides high-level oversight through strategic reviews of all tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concrete knowledge of all areas of digital marketing and media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adhere to and meet deadlines and project manage multiple requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent client relationship and management skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven problem-solving skills and ability to think outside of the box for creative solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and motivate team members in a positive light&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail oriented and responsive, deadline-driven with strong quantitative reasoning skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivers results against priorities proactively with little or no senior input&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3235 - Senior Associate, Analytics - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind was awarded the ZEUR assignment for Nestle Europe in 2024. With 47 countries, +450 team members, and regular new product launches, the account is looking for a Senior Analyst to provide Marketing &amp;amp; Campaign analytics for the North Cluster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Analyst is an experienced media analyst as part of the North Cluster specialist team, responsible for developing strong relationships with the Nestle team across UK, Ireland and the Nordics, providing excellent marketing effectiveness skills and have the knowledge/skills to push innovative thinking as well as best in class analysis. You will be an excellent communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports the implementation of MROI into media tools and integration of business results into campaign planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in marketing effectiveness analyses (budget forecasting, portfolio optimization, competitive analysis) and campaign measurement &amp;amp; testing with team’s support, provide recommendation on budget optimization and measurement tools and methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the conduit between markets helping distil insights and distributing insights from media activity across the cluster, provide trainings with clients &amp;amp; internal teams on analytics approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the analytics manager &amp;amp; director to champion marketing effectiveness across the cluster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate with the broader effectiveness analytics community to learn and ensure learning are shared&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in delivering the clients learning agenda across campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure we are delivering agency best practice across analytics areas such as PCAs and experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thirst for learning about technology, trends, media, people, brands and the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketing with a focus on analytics – role would be ideally suited for a very media savvy analyst or a very analytically focused planner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed media, marketing and measurement knowledge across all channels, FMCG experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to convert analysis into real world actionable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client facing and multi-tasking skills, with the ability to explain complex analysis clearly and simply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Excel, common econometrics packages, statistics and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative problem-solving mentality focused on providing robust, pragmatic solutions to adhoc client questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambitious, determined and self-motivated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3013 - &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Director, Director, Product Enablement - AI, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP’s Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions is the WPP’s unified global data products and technology team. We work with our agencies and clients to build data data-driven solutions and technology product to power marketing transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Open is our AI platform for marketing, it connects marketing professionals, data, tools and AI in a single place. WPP Open is the simplest, safest and fastest way to realize the benefits of scaled AI – delivering better-informed creative ideas faster, at scale and at lower cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re endlessly curious and our team of thinkers, builders, creators and problem solvers are over 2,000 strong, across 20 markets around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Global App Enablement is a highly skilled and proactive leader who translates product strategy into scalable enablement programs, equipping the business to drive meaningful platform adoption and value realisation through consistent, high-quality resources. Your will work autonomously, taking accountability for creating, executing and distributing these resources and building a long-term strategic roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess the autonomy to execute all tasks independently, with a long-term horizon and broad scope of influence, and are ready to mentor and guide others within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be the SME across potentially multiple [CAPABILITY AREAS] and design, develop and execute enablement programs that drive adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will partner with cross-discipline product and go to market teams to support current capabilities and future releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will build trust quickly, fostering strong relationships with partners and stakeholders who will help to deliver enablement ‘to the edge’ allowing us to reach the scale of our full organization and value from our capabilities. They will see you as their trusted advisor and SME in the App/Capability areas that you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will monitor adoption metrics to identify areas for improvement and increased engagement, contributing directly to the platform&#39;s success and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will champion the voice of the customer and contribute to the continued enhancement of our capabilities through data-driven and balanced feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work closely with other Global Enablement Leads to ensure that processes, ways of working and outputs are consistent and high quality across our different Platform and App Capability areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have strong people leadership skills and a core ability to influence others with autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic&amp;nbsp;Product Enablement &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage or mentor and guide more junior team members and stakeholders on expert product use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set or contribute to OKRs for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders and navigate the org ensuring you’re able to influence outcomes with little or no support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently develop a deep, practical understanding of app capabilities, their features, benefits, and strategic place within agency and client business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide significant input to product roadmaps, influencing product evolution based on client needs, data driven feedback and market dynamics to drive full value&amp;nbsp;realisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, lead, and implement comprehensive enablement programs tailored for various partner and customer groups aimed at delivering consistent and effective product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaled Content &amp;amp; Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate product features and released into best-in-class, user-centric enablement materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and&amp;nbsp;scale knowledgebase articles, guides, and playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform the design and development of scalable training materials and resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather input from the enablement and champion community to continuously audit and improve materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to establish consistent messaging and documentation&amp;nbsp;across the enablement ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community &amp;amp; Knowledge Distribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the readiness of Regional/Client Enablement and Champion networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accessible, well-structured knowledge hubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead delivery for global community forums and knowledge-sharing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion platform and capability education, delivering training for internal communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather structured feedback from partners, champions and users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel insights through&amp;nbsp;defined mechanisms to Platform/Capability&amp;nbsp;leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;gaps in enablement coverage and content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively gather&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;analyse&amp;nbsp;complex user feedback and be the voice of the user/client. Channel insights back to Platform/Capability development, influencing improvements and adoption&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in platform/product enablement, client success, product marketing or a similar role, demonstrating a strong track record of autonomously driving product adoption and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in advertising or related field, with a solid understanding of complex agency operating structures, competitive technology and Media, Production and Creative capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong comprehension of how commerce data &amp;amp; technology is used by agencies and advertisers to bolster their clients’ business operations and strategies. First-hand experience with third-party commerce products and platforms is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with streamlining workflows through technology, ideally AI-powered&amp;nbsp;automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills to track adoption, engagement, and utilization metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to contribute to and implement comprehensive enablement strategies and&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;the creation of impactful supporting materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, stakeholder management and interpersonal abilities, with a focus on building trust, fostering collaboration and building strong relationships across highly matrixed, multi-geographical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to lead multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in delivering training sessions and acting as a subject matter expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling and presentation skills for delivering impactful&amp;nbsp;product demos and training sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate resourcefulness and practical thinking in demanding, fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong and flexible work ethic; able to thrive under pressure, juggle multiple responsibilities, and consistently deliver high-quality results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are ready to be at the forefront of the AdTech industry, shaping its future, and driving success for both our clients, we encourage you to apply and join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3290 - Associate Director, Planning - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to take genuine ownership of communications planning for a well-established brand with an ambitious, collaborative client marketing team. Whether you&#39;re already operating at Director level or a high-performing Planning Manager ready to make that leap, this role will put you at the heart of shaping innovative, insight-led media strategies that genuinely move the needle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who brings both strategic firepower and hands-on energy - someone who lights up when presented with a complex brief, who builds trust with clients and partners effortlessly, and who makes the people around them better. If that sounds like you, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the planning response to briefs from start to finish - setting the bar for what &quot;best in class&quot; looks like on this account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep, nuanced understanding of the client&#39;s brand, category, competitive landscape, and business challenges, becoming a true strategic partner, not just a supplier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead key media updates across landscape trends, emerging platforms, research, and media owner innovations, keeping the team and client ahead of the curve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion WPP capabilities and integrated ways of working, embodying the &#39;Power of &amp;amp;&#39; mindset across media and creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and nurture key relationships with brand leads, agency partners, and media owners, building genuine partnerships built on trust and mutual ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a confident, compelling presence in the room - comfortable presenting bold ideas to senior clients, external partners, and internal stakeholders alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Client Director and Client Lead to uncover opportunities for revenue growth, innovation, and expanded ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account &amp;amp; Team Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead day-to-day account workflow, governance, and ways of working, with support from the Client Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the implementation and delivery of media activation, managing workflow effectively through activation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive campaign reporting that goes beyond the numbers, ensuring insights are clear, compelling, and actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead post-campaign evaluations (PCAs) with the support of the Planning Manager and Planning Executive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear oversight of financial account management - billings, reconciliations, accruals, and finance queries, with accuracy and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively anticipate and resolve planning challenges before they become problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, inspire, and develop your Planning Manager and Planning Executive through regular 1-2-1s, meaningful feedback, and genuine investment in their growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the account&#39;s profile across the agency - producing, submitting, and championing award-worthy work that the team is proud to talk about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the adoption of agency tools and processes, including WPP Open, across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re the kind of person who champions and challenges in equal measure - yourself, your team, and your clients. You hold yourself to a high standard, and you bring others up with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant, relevant media planning experience with deep expertise across ATL and a strong grasp of the full digital landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of delivering standout communications planning, with measurement, effectiveness, and clear objectives always front of mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp client management skills: the ability to build credibility and confidence with both junior and senior stakeholders, with natural gravitas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation skills, both in crafting compelling narratives and delivering them with impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge and hands-on application of core media planning tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end planning experience, from initial brief through to PCA - with no part of the process unfamiliar to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter mentality: curious, proactive, and energised by a fast-paced, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding attention to detail, with a drive to ensure every output - however big or small - reflects genuine craft and excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, open approach, a great listener who works well across a wide range of teams, disciplines, and personalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to juggle multiple workstreams simultaneously, staying cool, flexible, and focused under pressure.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3540 - Associate Director, eCommerce - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are seeking an experienced Retail Media leader to drive strategic planning, client delivery, and team performance across a portfolio of commerce accounts. This role combines deep retail media expertise with strong account leadership, responsible for developing insight-led strategies, overseeing end-to-end campaign execution, and delivering measurable business outcomes across key platforms including Amazon, CitrusAd, Criteo, Skai, and Pacvue.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Leadership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Lead the end-to-end output of the team across client-facing work and operational delivery. Ensure consistently high standards, with strong adherence to processes, controls, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Business Understanding&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the client’s business, objectives, and KPIs. Apply this to shape effective, insight-led retail media strategies that drive measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media Platform Expertise (Amazon, Citrus, Criteo)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrate strong experience working across key retail media platforms including Amazon, CitrusAd, and Criteo. Apply platform expertise to guide planning, optimisation, and performance, ensuring best-in-class execution across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Proactive Thinking&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Stay informed on industry trends, platform developments, and new product releases. Proactively identify and introduce opportunities to enhance client performance and maintain a competitive edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Partner Relationship Management&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key client stakeholders and media partners. Act as a trusted point of contact, confidently contributing insights and recommendations beyond immediate scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Support and develop a high-performing team, fostering a collaborative and accountable working environment. Take an active role in coaching, performance management, and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Leadership&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Lead day-to-day communications across clients, partners, and internal stakeholders, ensuring clear alignment and effective delivery. Engage senior leadership when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Process Improvement&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Continuously identify opportunities to improve efficiency through better processes, automation, and adoption of tools and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Process Ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Oversee activation-related financial processes, ensuring accuracy, compliance, and timely delivery across all campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Performance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of measurement frameworks and partner capabilities. Use this knowledge to guide optimisation strategies and performance discussions with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workshops &amp;amp; Strategic Contribution&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Lead and contribute to client workshops and planning sessions, bringing structured thinking, insight, and strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams (including GOC) to ensure seamless integration and consistent, high-quality execution across all workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media Integration&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Play a key role in embedding retail media within broader client strategies, identifying opportunities to connect activity across the wider marketing mix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Product Development&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Support the development and testing of commerce products and solutions in collaboration with partners such as Skai, ensuring continued innovation and relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Set clear objectives with your line manager and demonstrate ongoing growth in leadership, strategic thinking, and client impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, our culture and people are at the heart of everything we do. In this role, it is essential to embody WPP and WPP Media’s core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by leading collectively to inspire transformational creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open Environment&lt;/strong&gt; by balancing people and client needs, cultivating trust and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by championing growth and development to drive progress across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;eCommerce and retail media&lt;/strong&gt;, including campaign set-up, management, optimisation, and reporting across both media owner and technology vendor platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;strategic and tactical application of retail media and digital marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to translate this into effective client solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven hands-on experience across the Amazon ecosystem, with a solid understanding of the wider UK retail landscape (e.g. Tesco, Sainsbury’s, ASDA, Morrisons, Ocado) and quick commerce partners (e.g. Deliveroo, Uber Eats).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;bid management platforms&lt;/strong&gt; such as Skai and Pacvue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated &lt;strong&gt;project management and team leadership experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to manage multiple workstreams and deliver against deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;stakeholder management skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience coordinating across clients, internal teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of &lt;strong&gt;data literacy&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to interpret performance data and translate insights into clear strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring accuracy and quality across all outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident &lt;strong&gt;communication and storytelling skills&lt;/strong&gt;, able to present ideas and strategies clearly and persuasively to a range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective &lt;strong&gt;team management capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;, including workload prioritisation, clear communication, and supporting team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-focused mindset with the ability to remain &lt;strong&gt;calm under pressure&lt;/strong&gt; and navigate complex or fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine drive to &lt;strong&gt;elevate work beyond the expected&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing energy, curiosity, and continuous improvement to the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3361 - Associate Director, Analytics Modelling Services, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics is WPP’s data, analytics, product and technology division. We’re on a mission to transform marketing by building the fastest, most connected data platform that bridges marketing strategy to scaled activation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We work with agencies and clients to transform the value of data by bringing together technology, data and analytics capabilities. We deliver this through the Open Media Studio, an AI-enabled media and data platform for the next era of advertising.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re endlessly curious. Our team of analytical thinkers, builders, creators and problem solvers are over 1,000 strong, across 20 markets around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Analytics team is one of our strongest globally, with 120 Analysts providing WPP Media’s clients with a full range of Analytics services that make tangible differences to our clients. There are three key teams within WPP Media Analytics UK:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modelling Services team&lt;/strong&gt; – this is the largest part of the team and is responsible for all of our modelling work, including MMM, brand health modelling, RBA and other bespoke modelling solutions. Most of this team’s work is out of scope and sold in as paid for additional service to our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied Analytics &lt;/strong&gt;–&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;this part of the team conducts most other forms of day-to-day analytics for our clients, often working closely with the modelling team, but not undertaking the modelling themselves. Their responsibilities are broad and are centred around embedding analytics into our day-to-day media planning. Their responsibilities include helping clients with their measurement frameworks, using the modelling work done by our teams or external agencies, owning the test and learn roadmap, setting up and measuring media tests and adding the insight to our PCAs. This team is often included directly in our media planning fees, with many people fully FTE’d on clients. Their time is also sold on a project basis. Sitting within this team are our three Agency Leads, each one acting as the main point of contact between the agency client teams and all our UK Analytics team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science &amp;amp; Solutions team &lt;/strong&gt;– the smallest, but still crucial part of the team. This team have two key roles. Firstly, they deliver any modelling outside of that undertaken in the Modelling Services team. Secondly, they build bespoke tools and solutions for our UK team, which assist the other Analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to a Director+, the role of the Associate Director is responsible for the running a team of econometricians, overseeing and fronting the analytics projects across a number of clients. The Associate Director is the key client contact, understanding the business, building relationships and capitalising on opportunities to grow our analytics further.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line-manage a team of 3-6 direct reports with responsibility for their growth and development through regular feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver significant income annually with a large amount of complexity to the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the senior analytics sponsor, responsible for the overall client relationship and quality of work delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure junior team are completing data processing correctly and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge and stretch outputs of client analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ultimate responsibility for integration with all WPP Media departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead commercial excellence across the department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute towards the department’s annual income growth targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge and experience of Market Mix Modelling and other techniques within the media industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with clients from a variety of sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to anticipate and manage the needs/demands of senior clients, by using influence and negotiation skills &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to remain calm under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement with proven experience in delivering solutions and decisions that positively impact WPP Media or client businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of typical tools and techniques used in marketing analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen attention to detail with a questioning mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle multiple projects/clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced R or other statistical software user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
