&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will be an integral part of the Avionics, Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control (AGNC) department, specifically the Avionics Control Systems team, that designs, tests and integrates electronic control units for the Spectrum launch vehicle. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will be the product owner of the Thrust Vector Control Actuator of the Spectrum Launch Vehicle. You will own the lifecycle of it, manage associated interfaces and ensure delivery on time, budget and scope. Interdisciplinary tasks and fast paced R&amp;amp;D are your daily business, and you thrive in that kind of environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on unit level tasks for your product including design, qualification &amp;amp; acceptance testing, as well as integration and return analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the product owner of the PCB of your product, drive requirements definition, schematic capture, layout and design verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own all interfaces of your products across their lifecycle, from unit to system level integration &amp;amp; testing, including all technical and programmatic interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and develop procedures for automated end-of-line testing of your hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and conduct vehicle integration and testing for your products, both in Germany and on the launch pad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build up and maintain automated qualification &amp;amp; acceptance testing infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the definition of the Avionics architecture and associated technology roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;University Degree in Electrical Engineering or comparable&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;2+ years of working experience with Electric or electrohydraulic drives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Power Electronics and Electrical Machines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Control of Electrical Machines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Experience in the verification of Electrical Drives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Experience in E-CAD tools (Schematic &amp;amp; Layout Design), preferably Altium Designer&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Experience in verification of complex circuitry, such as embedded systems, DCDC converter and analog frontends&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-1&quot; class=&quot;_kqswh2mm _bfhku67f _18u01wug _2hwx1wug&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;Hands On mentality, can-do attitude&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in spoken and written English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Electronic Unit design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with electrohydraulic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous product ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in embedded software or digital design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program: &lt;/strong&gt;Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket: &lt;/strong&gt;Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;menur2kop&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;We use Metaview to record interview audio so our team can review it later and stay focused during the conversation. We will record interviews only if you opt in. Please note that we will request your consent separately during the interview process. Participation is completely voluntary and will not affect your application in any way. For more information on how we process your personal data, please see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://deu01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fisaraerospace.com%2Fprivacy-policy&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cbritta.bonn%40ext.isaraerospace.com%7Cbf5a1173fd434834ab1c08dea5c061eb%7C50154d7ed4fe4770bb43bf09a927cc45%7C0%7C0%7C639130442882001477%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=l1vw27o02fEuCFAICyAHO91ObS%2FjnXDl5woYeGiSRek%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Systems Engineer, you will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;the technical outcome of complex space missions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;During mission contracting and requirements development, you may work with the sales engineering org to ensure mission requirements are valid and mission scope is adequately defined. Systems Engineers translate higher level requirements down to lower-level requirements, consulting and collaborating with discipline team-leads and subject matter experts where necessary.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the overall technical lead responsible for &quot;building the right thing&quot; and &quot;building it right&quot;. This will include the management of system requirements, technical budgets, and sub-system interfaces.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your responsibility extends to ensuring there is sufficient verification and testing of the system, and you will take ownership of the technical performance outcomes for the mission. You will be the mission&#39;s&amp;nbsp;technical lead for both Spire-internal and external (customer, contractor, etc) teams, working collaboratively with others to resolve technical discrepancies in requirements, specifications, or system performance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also act as the technical point of contact for Spire&#39;s global customers during mission development phases and through on-orbit validation of the space systems, working with Spire project and program managers to provide effective communication where required.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your knowledge and experience working across multiple technical disciplines will help you coordinate Spire&#39;s technical efforts to ensure ultimate mission success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take overall technical ownership of Spire Space and/or Ground Systems from technical development through on-orbit verification; ensure that we are &quot;building the right thing&quot; and “building it right”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead requirements management for a given mission or program - including development, validation, verification, and change management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical risk management for a given mission or program - including identification, qualification, mitigation, and resolution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop top-level requirements and then flow-down to lower-levels, consulting and collaborating with discipline team-leads and subject matter experts where necessary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary Spire technical POC to customers and contractors - communicating and advocating on behalf of internal technical teams where necessary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the customer&#39;s technical representative to Spire-internal teams - communicating and sometimes advocating for customer requirements, expectations, and experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop working knowledge of Spire&#39;s satellite platforms, operations systems, and payloads (both Spire and customer-developed) - including customer APIs and software service interfaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively communicate to program/project managers where changes in scope, requirements, expected system performance, or development outcomes&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;the mission.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deliver, and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;mission documentation&amp;nbsp;required&amp;nbsp;to support programs or missions, including both internal and external (customer- or contractor-facing) documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales engineering team in the development of technical concepts and budgets, feasibility assessments, requirements, scope, and documentation needed during the sales cycle.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Engineering, Computer Science, equivalent STEM-related subject, or equivalent work experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in a technical engineering discipline (Mechanical, Electrical, Software, Controls, RF Communications, etc) or as a systems engineer for complex integrated systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive understanding of space systems, concepts of operations, and remote systems operation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a space systems engineer working across engineering disciplines (Mechanical, Electrical, Software, Controls, Radio/Comms, etc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing or integrating RF and optical payloads.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;participating&amp;nbsp;in architecture and design of digital systems including ground station networks, data distribution and data processing systems, and spacecraft data handling systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating or leading diverse technical teams spanning multiple engineering disciplines and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills for building relationships with clients and effectively communicating with other members of cross-functional teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong comprehension skills to enable&amp;nbsp;timely&amp;nbsp;understanding of complex customer requirements and identification of thorough and sometimes unique solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in satellite mission design, development, and testing with a clear understanding of major mission design trades and scope drivers (power / payload duty cycle, communications systems / data budgets, ground stations, launch and environmental loads, EMI/EMC, thermal management, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spire operates a hybrid work model, and this position will require you to work a minimum of three days per week in the office.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightClicked SCXW152905918 BCX0&quot;&gt;Access to US export-controlled software and/or technology may be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightClicked SCXW152905918 BCX0&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightClicked SCXW152905918 BCX0&quot;&gt; for this role. If needed, Spire will arrange the necessary licenses—this is not something candidates need to have before applying.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;sub&gt;#LI-MK1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Global Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛰️ Name Your Satellite Program (NYSP)&lt;br&gt;🚀 Launch Attendance&lt;br&gt;🌴 Generous Time Off Policy&lt;br&gt;🎓 Education Assistance Program&lt;br&gt;🥰 Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;br&gt;📈 Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;br&gt;👣 Family Leave&lt;br&gt;💪 Fitness Reimbursement&lt;br&gt;🧡 Employee Referral Program&lt;br&gt;🍉 Healthy snacks &amp;amp; beverages in every office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Spire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;improve life on Earth with data from space.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spire Global is a space-to-cloud analytics company that owns and operates the largest multi-purpose constellation of satellites. Its proprietary data and algorithms provide the most advanced maritime, aviation, and weather tracking in the world. In addition to its constellation, Spire’s data infrastructure includes a global ground station network and 24/7 operations that provide real-time global coverage of every point on Earth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Spire is Global and our success draws upon the diverse viewpoints, skills and experiences of our employees. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer and are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, gender identity or veteran status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt;To help &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt;maintain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt; a safe and secure workplace for Spire employees, all candidates who receive a conditional offer will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt;be required&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt;to complete a background check&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt;. This &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW208825983 BCX0&quot;&gt;may include criminal history and employment verification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please take a moment to review &lt;a href=&quot;https://spire.com/global-data-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Spire&#39;s Global Data Privacy Notice for Employees, Contractors, Candidates and Visitors&lt;/a&gt;, as well as&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spire.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Spire&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kindly be advised that communication regarding your application may come from ----- ----- or from Candidate.fyi (our scheduling tool).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the center of this mission. You won&#39;t just deliver static slides; you will bridge the gap between technical possibilities and business imperatives, guiding clients from a focused short-term engagement with &lt;em&gt;Mittelstand&lt;/em&gt; manufacturers to multi-phase AI transformations with enterprises. In this role, you will take ownership of cross-functional workstreams, drive data-driven decision-making, and actively shape the digital future of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with (international) clients to understand their business needs and translate them into data-driven recommendations that support strategic decision-making and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect, synthesise and iterate data to create actionable insights. You work with a modern, AI-native toolstack - from LLM-powered environments (e.g. Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) and agentic workflow tools (e.g. n8n, Lovable) to coding assistants and automation platforms - and communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. Familiarity with SQL or Python remains a plus, but the ability to leverage AI tools to accelerate analysis and delivery is what we value most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of project workstreams and ensure high-quality, timely delivery in alignment with overall project goals. Work collaboratively within interdisciplinary teams across consulting, data, and tech functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of data strategies, AI use cases, and business intelligence solutions, contributing to governance frameworks and implementation roadmaps where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge sharing &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to a strong team culture by sharing knowledge, staying up to date with digital and AI trends, and supporting continuous team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business development &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to Artefact’s growth in Germany - supporting client proposals, shaping new service offerings, and creating intellectual capital such as frameworks, point-of-views, and benchmarks that strengthen our market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have at least 2–3 years of experience in management consulting, technology consulting, or in-house corporate strategy roles, with a proven track record of participating in data/AI strategy, cloud transformation, or applied AI/Machine Learning projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A completed university degree (Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s) in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a strong affinity for data management and modern AI technologies. You are familiar with concepts like Generative AI, LLMs, or predictive analytics and are eager to bridge the gap between business needs and AI deployment. Ideally, you have hands-on experience in AI use case conceptualization or data platform tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You combine strong analytical skills with a business-oriented perspective. You enjoy identifying business problems and translating them into practical AI and data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident working with PowerPoint and Google Slides to produce polished client-ready output. More importantly, you know how to leverage AI tools - from LLM environments to agentic workflows - to run analysis, generate insights, and accelerate delivery. Experience with SQL, BI tools, or programming languages is not a requirement, but comfort with structured data and a hands-on attitude toward new tools is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate complex technical topics clearly in both German and English. You enjoy working in interdisciplinary teams and collaborating across different levels and functions (e.g., translating requirements between business stakeholders and data scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proactive, structured, and solution-oriented, with a strong client focus and stakeholder understanding. You thrive in dynamic environments and enjoy solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent German and English are required - you will participate in client workshops, present to senior stakeholders, and write deliverables in both languages. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful client work:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on challenging projects with leading national and international clients across data, digitalisation, and advanced data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in performance over tenure. Your growth is driven by your impact, not your length of service, with clear opportunities to progress and diverse career prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong compensation package including a performance-based bonus, which is paid out half-yearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of passionate Data Consultants who actively support each other. You&#39;ll learn through diverse projects, collaboration, and exposure to leading experts in the field - including international work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; time off: &lt;/strong&gt;Hybrid working model, 28 days of annual leave, plus your birthday as well as Christmas &amp;amp; New Year&#39;s Eve&amp;nbsp;off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-preview__description &quot; data-test-description=&quot;&quot;&gt;
